  "text": "### 1. Process Risk  \n**Process failures causing errors or delays:**\n- Account opening errors\n- Payment processing failures\n- Reconciliation errors\n- Fraud detection failures  \n**Mitigation:**\n- Standard operating procedures (SOPs)\n- Staff training\n- Supervisory review\n- Automation where possible",
